    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let's use fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season. It's for hay fever. Keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night. If you start wheezing, that's the point to come in urgently.",
